# Copied to public/client/.assetsignore by `npm run build`. Patterns
# here are excluded from the Cloudflare static-assets upload (gitignore
# syntax).
#
# The assets directory is ./public/client (the @cloudflare/vite-plugin
# client output). The worker build (public/rsss/, with its generated
# .dev.vars + wrangler.json) lives outside the assets dir, so it is
# never uploaded and needs no exclusion here.
#
# Source maps are emitted into public/client/assets in production
# ('hidden' sourcemaps for Sentry upload) and must not be served
# publicly.

*.map
